{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1359.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"ab40bbfa499c72dc13f711bd3ab8f70a476337c8ea62ed77cce5a2540530acf3","ja":"注目の役者","zh":"备受瞩目的演员","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1359.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b3833299e36e9ba8811dd42fd5d09aa39da021d51ba25e496ff7e5fc53b36bdc","ja":"あっ、志保発見ー♪\nここにいたんだね。","zh":"啊，发现志保了——♪\n原来你在这里啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1359.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"7c2ed356d21e7dda84f3a108f47dde6b9170c632d5ca041c1de41fd88050e9f3","ja":"ねえ、この雑誌読んだ？　私たちが出演した\n映画のことが記事になってるんだよ。","zh":"你看这本杂志了吗？上面登了\n我们出演的那部电影的报道呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1359.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"bb2ec6f309f003a6e0650d40cab1eb173c142f25ee7ece3734c43f4b6590ec93","ja":"いえ、まだ読んでないです。\nどんな内容なんですか？","zh":"没有，我还没读过。\n讲的是什么内容呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1359.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"376f56cab825cbce768bbf697af77964ccefef60e8928d261e273beb1bb7a5d5","ja":"その記事なんだけど……なんと、\n志保の男役がピックアップされてるんだよ！","zh":"那篇报道里……竟然重点\n介绍了志保的反串男角哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1359.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"f092472aa8b3dfcc8b7997173b5eca81433168bdad0a098dd57f7a820da88a2b","ja":"すごいよね～！　でも、志保の\nあの演技を思い出したら、納得しちゃうな。","zh":"真厉害呢～！不过，只要回想起志保\n当时的演技，就完全能理解了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1359.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"429bab18831563c3829401f94d5cd3195d054eff910ef1f07cfed8993292e054","ja":"あ、ありがとうごいます。私はいつも通り、\n役作りをして演じただけなんですけど……。","zh":"谢、谢谢您。我只是和平常一样，\n揣摩好角色然后去演而已……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1359.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"fabd7543b713536cb7af34ea652fc8e6c7f1d4f2345027c64d07f89032f9bb2e","ja":"その役作りがよかったんだよ！　女性が男役を\nするときって、気持ちだけじゃダメって言うし！","zh":"那种塑造角色的方式很棒哦！毕竟大家都说，\n女性反串男角的时候，光靠心意可是不行的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1359.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"43dff9a1b9a44fc842629e9edfa324689fddf31e433b7866c881ae72f1fc5188","ja":"異性の役を演じるときって、\n体の動かし方も変える必要があるんだよね！","zh":"扮演异性角色的时候，\n连肢体动作也得改变才行呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1359.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"58e1c9c4aae8462f3d5eef9a99d7e6e2773d02e6104af20d18c386b75500e488","ja":"もしかして志保、いつも通りって言いながら、\nなにか特別なことをしたんじゃないの！？","zh":"难道志保你嘴上说着和平常一样，\n其实做了什么特别的事吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1359.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"9334f3c0c4e132df9881d7dfefa30ec6221538261dc781e405f08186327c4c1e","ja":"私も気になる！\nどうやって、男役をマスターしたの？","zh":"我也很好奇！\n你是怎么掌握男役诀窍的？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1359.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"d888c20ec1ed95317f0ce27e31a2f516c02a2931b3eda88d385dfb6cf3af076b","ja":"教えて、教えてー！","zh":"快告诉我、快告诉我嘛——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1359.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"3da20ca485473078fe35664db5e08a3264a1e0070863b91dfa37ee606ad8f2a1","ja":"わ、わかりました。教えますから、\nふたりとも落ち着いてください！","zh":"我、我知道了。我会告诉你们的，\n两位都先冷静一下！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
